        "why": "Chosen over ambientCG PaintedPlaster017: square, known real size, finer stucco relief; PaintedPlaster017 is 2:1, has no published size and a smeared patch in its normal map. The source is a mid grey with a lilac cast, so the albedo is calibrated to a neutral white (mean linear 0.72, variation kept) so a pastel tint can multiply it directly."
